<title>USA: Zycad says chief financial officer dies.</title>
<headline>Zycad says chief financial officer dies.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zycad Corp said Wednesday that Chief Financial Officer Peter Cassidy died Tuesday following a cardiac arrest.</p>
<p>Cassidy, 53, had been with the company as CFO since 1990.</p>
<p>Stephen Flory, corporate controller, will assume the functions of the CFO in the near term, Zycad said.</p>
